          "notes": "ONE checkpoint serves all three presets. Every other MiniMax H3 pack needs two 19.53 GB files - FL2VA for text/image to video and REF2VA for reference to video - so this pack is roughly 19.5 GB lighter for the same coverage. Four steps, euler/simple, with the sigma shift at 12.0 video / 3.0 audio; the distillation is baked into the checkpoint, so there is no Turbo LoRA and nothing extra to install: the only prerequisite is the rgthree Power Lora Loader that SimpliGen already ships and every H3 preset uses. The other H3 packs additionally need ComfyUI-MiniMax-H3-Turbo cloned in manually. Measured against our six-step Turbo LoRA preset on identical references, prompt, audio and seed: 1.7-2.3 minutes per five-second shot against about 3, with no audible difference in the generated audio. It reads the scene brighter and wider than the stock checkpoint, which is a look, not a fault - pick another H3 pack if you want the darker, tighter reading. THE DOWNLOAD NEEDS A CIVITAI API KEY: the author requires you to be signed in, so add one in Settings before installing. It is a free model, not paid access."
